# /etc/bluebird/ 아래 구역별로 필요한 파일만 둔다. 권한 0600 root:root. 저장소에는 예시만.

# ---- bluebird.env (모든 서버)
BB_VERSION=0.1.0

# ---- collect.env (Z1 수집 서버)
BB_SOURCES=/config/sources.toml
BB_SEED_DIR=/srv/bluebird/seed
BB_STATE_DIR=/srv/bluebird/state
# 망연계 솔루션 송신 폴더
BB_OUTBOX=/srv/bluebird/xfer/out-to-z2
BB_SIGN_KEY=/keys/z1.key
BB_ANON_SECRET=/keys/z1.anon_secret
# 외부 API 키 (수집 어댑터 확장 시)
# DATA_GO_KR_SERVICE_KEY=
# NAVER_HUB_CLIENT_ID=
# NAVER_HUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# KIPRIS_PLUS_KEY=
# LAW_OC=

# ---- import-core.env / publish.env (Z2 처리 서버)
BB_DSN=postgresql://bluebird:<password>@10.20.10.21:5432/bluebird_core?sslmode=verify-full
# 망연계 솔루션 수신 폴더
BB_INBOX=/srv/bluebird/xfer/in-from-z1
BB_DONE_DIR=/srv/bluebird/xfer/done
BB_QUARANTINE_DIR=/srv/bluebird/xfer/quarantine
BB_PEER_PUBKEY=/keys/z1.pub
BB_OUTBOX=/srv/bluebird/xfer/out-to-z3
BB_SIGN_KEY=/keys/z2.key

# ---- import-publish.env (Z3 웹 서버)
# BB_DSN=postgresql://bluebird:<password>@172.16.30.21:5432/bluebird_publish?sslmode=verify-full
# BB_INBOX=/srv/bluebird/xfer/in-from-z2
# BB_DONE_DIR=/srv/bluebird/xfer/done
# BB_QUARANTINE_DIR=/srv/bluebird/xfer/quarantine
# BB_PEER_PUBKEY=/keys/z2.pub

# ---- portal.env (Z3 웹 서버)
# PORTAL_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://bluebird_portal:<password>@172.16.30.21:5432/bluebird_publish?sslmode=verify-full
